One lakh families will lead a good life.

257
00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:08.083
With schools, colleges, and hospitals.

258
00:22:08.166 --> 00:22:09.750
A village will transform into a city.

259
00:22:10.583 --> 00:22:12.458
