463
00:34:31.416 --> 00:34:32.250
Guys.

464
00:34:36.416 --> 00:34:37.333
MAHA METRO

465
00:35:14.041 --> 00:35:15.416
-Hold your fire.
-Copy, ma'am.

466
00:35:16.333 --> 00:35:17.166
Ma.

467
